    <briefdescription>
<para>Focused thread-safety test for ConcurrentCompactor. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Verifies that g_total_compaction_time_ms is accumulated correctly when multiple worker threads execute compaction tasks concurrently. The race condition (non-atomic load-modify-store) was fixed with a compare_exchange_weak retry loop (2026-08-10).</para>
<para>Test IDs: SPLINTER_TS_01, SPLINTER_TS_02 </para>
